{
  "name": "Day 36 Solution: AI Integration Fundamentals",
  "description": "Webhook-triggered workflow that runs input text through a mode-switching OpenAI call (summarize/classify/enhance/analyze) and then a second OpenAI call that produces analyst-style insights on the first call's output.",
  "tags": [
    "week-06",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-36",
    "openai",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 36 Solution: AI Integration Fundamentals\n\nDemonstrates a basic two-step OpenAI chain: a mode-switching processor (summarize/classify/enhance/analyze) feeds an analyst node that adds insights and recommendations based on the first call's output.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key (billing enabled).\n\n**Reference:** WEEK_06_AI_AGENTS/DAILY_TASKS/DAY_36_AI_Integration_Fundamentals.md",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-workflow-trigger",
      "name": "AI Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ai-workflow",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-input",
      "name": "Prepare Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "input_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "processing_mode",
              "value": "={{ $json.mode || 'summarize' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "process-text-mode-switch",
      "name": "Process Text (Mode Switch)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a helpful assistant that processes text based on the requested mode. Available modes: summarize, classify, enhance, analyze. Perform the requested processing on the text only — do not repeat the mode label back in your answer."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Mode: ' + $json.processing_mode + '\\nText: ' + $json.input_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-insights-analyst",
      "name": "Generate Insights (Analyst)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1080,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI analyst that provides insights and recommendations based on already-processed text."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Processed output: ' + $json.message.content + '\\n\\nOriginal input: ' + $('Prepare Input').item.json.input_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.5,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "AI Workflow Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Input": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process Text (Mode Switch)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process Text (Mode Switch)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Insights (Analyst)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "1",
  "id": "day_36_solution"
}